flowchart LR
    Player --> Guide[Optional visible guidance]
    Guide --> Navigation[Existing destination navigation]
    Player --> Requests[Existing explicit request command]
    Requests --> Logistics[Authoritative automatic logistics]
    Logistics --> Truck[Existing physical Dispatch and vehicle owners]
    Truck --> Facts[Detached handling and fuel facts]
    Facts --> UI[Current selected request and truck feedback]
    Rear[Committed rear changes] --> Guide
    Army[Real demand and receipt owners] --> Guide
    Objectives[Actual capture and income owner] --> Feedback[Battlefield feedback]
